{"id":"50ca0f1caf2e947c","group":"93","path":"93/93-fact-congruence-join.md","title":"Congruence Join","display":"Congruence Join","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-fact-congruence-join","aliases":["93-fact-congruence-join"],"display":"Congruence Join","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-permutable]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-fact-congruence-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-fact-congruence-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence Join"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\">\\(\\mathbf{A}\\)</span> is an algebra</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta, \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\">\\(\\theta, \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\\)</span> are congruences on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\">\\(\\mathbf{A}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta \\circ \\varphi\">\\(\\theta \\circ \\varphi\\)</span> denotes the composition of relations</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi\">\\(\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi\\)</span> is the sourced congruence-lattice join of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Permutable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Permutable}\\)</span> is the typed predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b4de3484ad8d9669\" href=\"?note=b4de3484ad8d9669\" title=\"93-df-permutable\">93-df-permutable</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\varphi;\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi=\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\varphi;\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi=\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The congruence join fact states that for permutable congruences, the join (least upper bound) of two congruences equals their composition. This holds because permutable congruences allow the composition to form a lattice operation, simplifying the structure of the congruence lattice in modular varieties.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-permutable]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi$ is the sourced congruence-lattice join of [[93-df-congruence-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-permutable","status":"resolved","id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Permutable}$ is the typed predicate of [[93-df-permutable]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta, \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta \\circ \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Permutable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\varphi;\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\theta\\vee_{\\mathbf A}\\varphi=\\theta\\circ\\varphi=\\varphi\\circ\\theta","display":true}],"bytes":1205,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","b4de3484ad8d9669","135c0cfcbae1f3c5"]}